{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"swift","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Swift","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Swift (.swift).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"swift","name":"Swift","extensions":[".swift"],"grammar":"grammars/swift.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Swift","path":"snippets/swift.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/swift.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[@#][A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:precedencegroup|associatedtype|convenience|fallthrough|fileprivate|nonmutating|extension|subscript|typealias|continue|indirect|internal|mutating|operator|optional|override|protocol|required|rethrows|default|dynamic|postfix|private|unowned|willSet|deinit|import|prefix|public|repeat|return|static|struct|switch|throws|didSet|actor|async|await|break|catch|class|defer|final|guard|infix|inout|super|throw|where|while|case|else|enum|func|init|lazy|open|self|Self|some|weak|any|for|get|let|set|try|var|as|do|if|in|is)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|nil)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Dictionary|AnyObject|Character|Optional|Double|String|Result|Array|Float|Int16|Int32|Int64|Bool|Int8|UInt|Void|Any|Int|Set)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:precondition|debugPrint|fatalError|assert|stride|print|min|max|zip)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/swift.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"func\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"func ${1:name}(${2:_ arg: String}) -> ${3:Void} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Struct\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"struct\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"struct ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\tvar ${2:field}: ${3:String}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A struct\"\n  },\n  \"Class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"class\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\tinit() {\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\t}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class\"\n  },\n  \"Guard let\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"guard\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"guard let ${1:value} = ${2:optional} else {\",\n      \"\\t${3:return}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"guard let\"\n  },\n  \"If let\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"iflet\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"if let ${1:value} = ${2:optional} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"if let\"\n  },\n  \"Enum\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"enum\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"enum ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\tcase ${2:one}\",\n      \"\\tcase ${3:two}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An enum\"\n  },\n  \"SwiftUI view\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"view\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"struct ${1:Name}View: View {\",\n      \"\\tvar body: some View {\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\t}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A SwiftUI view\"\n  },\n  \"Print\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pr\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"print(${1:value})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"print\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Swift\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Swift.\n\n## Files\n\n`.swift`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 8 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `func` | A function |\n| `struct` | A struct |\n| `class` | A class |\n| `guard` | guard let |\n| `iflet` | if let |\n| `enum` | An enum |\n| `view` | A SwiftUI view |\n| `pr` | print |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}